SUMMARY:LFS Feminist Consciousness-Raising Film Afternoons
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\n**Feminist Film Afternoons #1: 
 Made in Dagenham (2010)**\n**What happens when women stop cooperating with
  a system that depends on their labor but refuses to value it?**\nJoin us 
 for the first of five Feminist Consciousness-Raising Film Afternoons\, fea
 turing *Made in Dagenham*\, the spirited\, funny\, and inspiring true stor
 y of women workers at Ford's Dagenham factory in England.\nIn 1968\, women
  sewing machinists discover that their work has been classified as unskill
 ed and paid less than men's. Rather than accept it\, they organize\, strik
 e\, and help launch a movement for equal pay.\n\n**After the film\, we'll 
 discuss:**\n\n* What changed when these women recognized their shared situ
 ation?\n* Why was withdrawing their labor more effective than simply deman
 ding fair treatment?\n* What could women accomplish today by collectively 
 withdrawing their cooperation from unequal systems?\n\nThis is a relaxed\,
  friendly afternoon of film and conversation—not a lecture or debate. Ev
 eryone is welcome to bring their own experiences and perspectives.\n\n**Th
 e Details**\n\n* **When:** Sunday\, November 15\, 2–5 PM\n* **Where:** M
 y home in Millersville. Address provided privately to confirmed attendees.
 \n* **Seating:** Limited to six guests.\n* **Attendance:** Women have prio
 rity through Saturday. If spaces remain\, men may RSVP beginning Saturday\
 , November 14 at noon. Please respect this reservation arrangement.\n* **G
 uests:** No additional guests\, please.\n\nThis is the first of five indep
 endent film afternoons\, held every other Sunday through January 10. Come 
 to one or come to several—there's no commitment to attend the entire ser
 ies.\n**Bring your curiosity\, your ideas\, and your willingness to imagin
 e something better!**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 317146005/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261026T150403Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261026T150403Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
