SUMMARY:New Restaurant tryout!  Evening Discussion and Dinner!
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nFor this month's evening discus
 sion meetup\, we are trying out a new restaurant! Diyo has been here for a
  while\, I've enjoyed their excellent food before\, but the venue is new t
 o LFS! Let us know if you like the food\, the location\, this change to ou
 r usual routine!\n\nEnjoy dinner and discussion at Diyo Nepalese Fusion wi
 th us\, 6:00pm\, Saturday November 21st!\n\nDiyo is in downtown Lancaster 
 City on Queen St.\, next to the Library and across from Binns Park! On-str
 eet parking is free after 6pm\, and several parking garages (Duke street\,
  Prince street\, Orange street\, Christian street garages) are within one 
 block!\n\nDiyo Fusion\n101 N Queen St. unit 115\nLancaster PA 17603
