SUMMARY:🌬️LFS Hike @Kelly's Run🥾🍁☀️
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nGorgeous hiking in the river hi
 lls just 30min south of Lancaster city for all nerds needing the psychosom
 atic (desperately!)😉. Open meadows\, idyllic brooks... will be plenty o
 f leaves and probably some wet rocks\, so waterproof hiking boots with exc
 ellent traction highly recommended. Includes moderately challenging terrai
 n with option for the difficult.🥾🍁\n\nFeatures easy parking w/very w
 ell-kept portable restroom.🚻\n\n🌬️Warm underlayers and water resis
 tant jacket/coat will keep you extra comfy in any November winds. Late aut
 umn hiking some of the best!☀️\n\nRain or shine🌦️\, preparation i
 s everything🧘🏼‍♂️.\n\n10AM\, in the parking lot near the Y for
 med by Old Holtwood Rd + Street Rd. Will gather by the the map. kiosk.🗺
 ️\n\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/ocLqA4ij3U915Szv7?g_st=ic
