SUMMARY:November Movie Night!
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nThis month\, we've got some exc
 ellent film options! They include:\n\nDownfall (Der Untergang)\n-Trailer- 
 https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uFG9a1NgfZA\n\nJudgement at Nuremburg\n-Tr
 ailer- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RfOgZXIQ6fo\n\nValkyrie\n-Trailer- 
 https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-YppIQUiE9Y&t=4s\n\nWe cannot guarantee be
 ing able to show this new documentary this month\, but are interested in g
 etting ahold of a copy to show in the near future!\nNAZA (2026)\n-Trailer-
  https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YIBRLEEaueo\n\nAnd many\, many more! Brin
 g your own film selections and we may decide to show them!\n\nAdmission is
  Free! Bring as many family members and friends as you would like! Please 
 RSVP! Discussion after the movie(s)\, hang out and share your thoughts!\n\
 nSome drinks and snacks will be provided\, please do bring more to share!\
 nPizza will be ordered\, please do chip in if you partake in delivered foo
 d!\n\nSaturday\, November 28th\, 6:00pm - 10:00pm\nOther Room Theater\n715
  N. Pine St.\nLancaster PA 17603\n\nWe can delay starting the movie to giv
 e people time to arrive\, but no later than 6:30pm\, please try to arrive 
 before then if you do not want to miss any of the movie.\n\nPICTURED below
  is the main entrance\, the event space is right up the stairs. On street 
 parking should be available\, several public parking lots such as behind C
 VS are within a 2 blocks walk along Harrisburg Pike.
